{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardkill System is a tactical top-down rogue-lite mech shooter where every projectile is simulated, and armor penetration values and hit angle make all the difference.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with hundreds of combinations of mech parts, weapons, ammo types, and upgrades. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520750/extras/6d5e536bd9caa9f52e3b1aa2d6f4d424.poster.avif?t=1763501543\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520750/extras/6d5e536bd9caa9f52e3b1aa2d6f4d424.webm?t=1763501543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520750/extras/6d5e536bd9caa9f52e3b1aa2d6f4d424.mp4?t=1763501543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemy machines by carefully targeting specific components and using the environment to your advantage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520750/extras/900bd601aec69b4f6cde3f4519bcd7f9.poster.avif?t=1763501543\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520750/extras/900bd601aec69b4f6cde3f4519bcd7f9.webm?t=1763501543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520750/extras/900bd601aec69b4f6cde3f4519bcd7f9.mp4?t=1763501543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Extraction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through a post-apocalyptic rock